[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package contains the sources of the auth_pam module only.  It does not
install a loadable module.

The module itself is built by the nginx ports.  To use it, build www/nginx,
www/nginx-devel or www/freenginx with the HTTP_AUTH_PAM option enabled.
Those ports pick the sources up from
%%PREFIX%%/share/nginx/modules/nginx-module-auth-pam
and produce ngx_http_auth_pam_module.so.

The module needs a PAM service of its own: put a file under
%%PREFIX%%/etc/pam.d, which does not exist by default, and name it in
auth_pam_service_name.  The worker runs as the web server's user, so a
service built on pam_unix(8) will not work -- that module reads files
only root may read.
EOM
}
]
